Jennifer Lawrence wasn't afraid to spill tea during her appearance on the Nov. 19 episode of &#x201C;Watch What Happens Live With Andy Cohen .&#x201D;

She appeared alongside her &#x201C;The Hunger Games : Sunrise on the Reaping&#x201D; co-star Josh Hutcherson and, in her trademark honesty, fielded plenty of questions, ranging from her on-screen roles to her opinion of the &#x201C;Real Housewives&#x201D; franchises. Related Stories The Best Disney Merch to Gift in 2026: Blu-ray Box Sets, Legos, Blind Boxes, Video Games and More Disney and the NFL Launch Limited-Edition Mickey & Friends Merch Ahead of Super Bowl LXI

At one point, Cohen asked Lawrence to rank her on-screen kisses from best to worst, including Hutcherson (whom she smooched in &#x201C;The Hunger Games: Catching Fire&#x201D;), Liam Hemsworth (&#x201C;The Hunger Games: Mockingjay &#x2014; Part 1&#x201D;), Chris Pratt (&#x201C;Passengers&#x201D;), Timoth&#xE9;e Chalamet (&#x201C;Don&#x2019;t Look Up&#x201D;) and Bradley Cooper (&#x201C;Silver Linings Playbook&#x201D; and &#x201C;Serena&#x201D;). blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Her ranking? Hutcherson was the best, and then Hemsworth, Cooper, Chalamet and Pratt at the bottom.

Elsewhere in the episode, she was candid about her breast implants. During a segment where she was discussing hot topics in the &#x201C;Real Housewives&#x201D; universe, Lawrence was asked about a storyline in which &#x201C;Real Housewives of New York&#x201D; star Hailey Glassman said her nose was broken by a woman&#x2019;s breast.

&#x201C;Is it a mystery to you how a boob could break Haley Glassman&#x2019;s nose?&#x201D; Cohen asked.

&#x201C;Yes, and I have implants,&#x201D; Lawrence said.

She then went on to say that &#x201C;they&#x2019;re new&#x201D; and shouted out Dr. Steven Teitelbaum in Santa Monica for his work. Cohen then asked about the size, and she said, &#x201C;It&#x2019;s a full C, I think. It&#x2019;s the same size that they were.&#x201D;

Elsewhere, when Cohen asked if she ever snagged a bow and arrow from the &#x201C;Hunger Games&#x201D; set as a souvenir, she said that she did but couldn&#x2019;t locate it. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

